refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.description;
stringfalsenullmb_ereg_replace stringpattern stringreplacement stringstring stringnulloptions&null;
Scans string for matches to pattern, then replaces the matched text with replacement

&reftitle.returnvalues;


 The resultant string on success, or &false; on error.
 If string is not valid for the current encoding, &null;
 is returned.

&reftitle.changelog;







     &Version;
     &Description;





     8.0.0

      options is nullable now.




     7.1.0

      The function checks whether string is valid for the
      current encoding.




     7.1.0

      The e modifier has been deprecated.
